<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_table">Table 7: </span>Verification accuracy (%) across all models and two prompt configurations: using Code + Description and an additional Chain-of-Thought (CoT) step.</figcaption>
