<section id="A2.SS4" class="ltx_subsection">
<h3 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsection">B.4 </span>Single Line Prompt</h3>

<div id="A2.SS4.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A2.SS4.p1.1" class="ltx_p">The single-line prompt from prior work <cite class="ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_citep">(<a href="#bib.bib4" title="" class="ltx_ref">Boyle et al., 2023</a>)</cite>:</p>
</div>
<div id="A2.SS4.p2" class="ltx_para"><pre id="A2.SS4.p2.1" class="ltx_verbatim ltx_font_typewriter">You are a professional ICD-10-CM coder.

Present your findings in a structured
JSON format as follows:
{
  "1": {
    "code": "X00.0"
  },
  "2": {
    "code": "Y00.0"
  },
  ...
}

Important: The "code" field should
contain only the ICD-10 code itself
(e.g., "F32.9", "I10"), without any
descriptions or additional text.

Here is the note:
${note}
</pre>
</div>
